 **Edge Cases and Pitfalls:**
-*   **Miniblock Skewing:** Linear skewing of miniblocks is required to guarantee that rendering pipelines always have access to four adjacent miniblocks in any of the three slice orientations [S1]. Failure to implement this skewing results in cache misses or incorrect gradient calculations [S1].
