 ## Operating characteristics
-*   **Time Complexity:** Real-time performance is achieved for $256^3$ volumes at 30 fps [S1]. The architecture processes 4 voxels per clock cycle across 4 pipelines [S2, unofficial].
-*   **Memory Complexity:** Requires 32–128 MBytes of off-chip SDRAM for volume storage and off-chip Pixel Memory for frame buffer output [S1][S2, unofficial]. The ASIC itself contains approximately 2 Mbits of on-chip SRAM [S2, unofficial].
